<h2 id="bottom-line">Bottom line</h2>
<p>Coursera makes money by charging learners for certificates, subscriptions and degrees, and by selling licenses to organizations, while sharing revenue with the institutions that build its courses. For you, the realistic Coursera side hustle is to learn a sellable skill and freelance with it, promote Coursera as an affiliate, or teach your own course on an open platform. At Better Side Hustles, we suggest picking the service first and the certificate second. Find more ideas on the <a href="/blog/">blog</a>.</p>
